---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy — Orthant" description="What the Orthant app and this website collect." path="/privacy/">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <h2>The app</h2>
    <p>
      Orthant has no account and sends no telemetry or account identifier. Your shortcuts,
      regions and settings stay on your Mac.
    </p>
    <p>
      Its only network access is checking for updates, which requests
      <code>updates.orthant.app</code>. That request carries no Orthant identifier, but like
      any HTTP request it necessarily exposes your IP address and user agent to the server.
      Installing an update then downloads the disk image from <code>github.com</code>.
      Automatic update checks can be turned off in <strong>Settings ▸ General</strong>.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views and measure performance.
      It sets no cookies and uses no cross-site identifiers.
    </p>

    <h2>Downloads</h2>
    <p>
      Downloads — from this site and from the app's updater alike — are served by GitHub.
      Clicking a download link sends a request to <code>github.com</code>, which receives it
      under
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's own privacy statement</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
